{"Title":"An Act relative to confidential plates for certain members of the judiciary","BillNumber":"H3291","DocketNumber":"HD842","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"E_C1","Name":"Edward F. Coppinger","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/E_C1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-17T13:54:56.74"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"E_C1","Name":"Edward F. Coppinger","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/E_C1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-17T13:54:56.74"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3291/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Coppinger of Boston, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3291) of Edward F. Coppinger relative to confidential registration plates for certain members of the judiciary.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 2 of chapter 90 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2018 Official Edition, is hereby amended by inserting after the last paragraph, in line 663, the following paragraph:-\r\n\t“The registrar, pursuant to its authority established under this section, shall furnish upon approval of an application by the registry to a justice or retired justice of the supreme judicial court, appeals court or trial court a confidential registration plate for use upon the private passenger vehicle registered to that individual. If the registrar denies an application for issuance of a confidential registration plate for said entities, the registrar shall provide the applicant with (i) a letter detailing the reasons for denial of the application; (ii) instructions on how to submit an appeal of the decision regarding the denial of the application; and (iii) an explanation of the appeals process.”.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}